# Map Routing

## Overview

This module calculates the distance and estimated arrival time between an ambulance and a hospital.

## Features

- Coordinate-based distance calculation
- ETA calculation
- Traffic factor support
- Nearby hospital identification
- Route service abstraction
- Mock coordinates for initial testing
- Backend-independent routing service

## Usage

The routing service accepts ambulance and hospital coordinates and returns the calculated distance and ETA.

Traffic factors can be applied to adjust the ETA based on traffic conditions.

## Testing

The module uses mock coordinates initially and includes simple test cases for distance, ETA, traffic, and hospital location calculations.

## Future Enhancement

A real map API can be integrated later without rewriting the entire routing module.
